  <item>
    <title>VOL.4 品牌时尚化：谁才是幕后推手？</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/656f45d6f6f2b065f0b54bba</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">656f45d6f6f2b065f0b54bba</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 06 Dec 2023 01:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><strong><span>本期简介丨</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>当三个“不时尚”的人要聊“时尚化”的时候，我们试图通过“三人三角色”的方式，探讨在商业市场语境下的“品牌时尚化 &amp; 幕后推手”：</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>品牌时尚化的意义在哪？</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>为什么主任认为有视野有Sense的职业经理人是真正推手？</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>是什么汽车行业经历改变了Ccino对“时尚”的理解？</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>真的如园长所言，广告公司真正推动着品牌的“时尚化”？</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><strong><span>内容索引丨</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="206">03:26</a> 品牌时尚化，三人三角色</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="379">06:19</a> 园长：广告公司是如何推动“品牌时尚化”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="438">07:18</a> 主任：“时尚化”的发展史</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="943">15:43</a> 主任：极氪&amp;领克的“时尚化”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2116">35:16</a> Ccino：时尚化是趋势，不是配置</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1460">24:20</a> Ccino：传统汽车的时尚化=便宜</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2534">42:14</a> 主任：职业经理人的时尚上位史</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2707">45:07</a> 哪些行业不适合“时尚化”？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3254">54:14</a> Ccino：时尚化是一个信息符号，而媒体是孕育它的温床</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>主播丨</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>园长（阿猩），黑园品牌咨询的园长，一只喜欢研究品牌策略、见人要胶头的猩猩。</span></p><span></span><p><span>主任，微信公号「科学营销派」主理人，爱唠叨爱研究，对着报告可以看很久很久。</span></p><span></span><p><span>Ccino，黑园品牌咨询的合伙人，一只侧面看是独角兽、正面看是缺角的羊，相信世界上没有事实、只有角度。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>播客简介丨</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>「园长和主任，品牌二元论」——这是由两位“90后品牌策略老友”主理的「品牌二元对谈」栏目，我们个性各异，旨在采用「二元相对」视角来探索品牌世界，通过各自的品牌策略思路对对碰，传递实用的策略知识和项目实操心得，希望给大家带来更多实用性强、记忆度高、趣味点多的品牌灵感。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>微信公众号丨</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>科学营销派（SCI-Marketing)</span></p><span></span><p><span>黑园品牌咨询（BlackZooBrand）</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>沟通联系丨</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>E-mail - zhoujiefan@blackzoo.com.cn</span></p><span></span><p><span>添加园长微信（zhoumouxing），即可加入《园长和主任》听友群</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>过往内容丨</span></strong></p><span></span><h2><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episodes/6360e4672e925d51c1194683" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episodes/6360e4672e925d51c1194683"><span>VOL.0 为什么我们要在播客里“对着干、冲着聊”？</span></a></h2><span></span><h2><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episodes/6367727daede8fbdf6484ffc" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episodes/6367727daede8fbdf6484ffc"><span>VOL.1 造车新势力（上）丨创始人精神能在市场上多卖几辆车？</span></a></h2><span></span><p><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episodes/636774afaede8fbdf6484fff" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episodes/636774afaede8fbdf6484fff"><span>VOL.1 造车新势力（下）丨创始人精神能在市场上多卖几辆车？</span></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episodes/63baae60da83c49d996a5ee1" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episodes/63baae60da83c49d996a5ee1"><span>VOL.2 精致餐饮行业的裂变之道——“守旧”还是“求变”？</span></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episodes/64cc9a7480c9ec4c5f5ca2a5" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episodes/64cc9a7480c9ec4c5f5ca2a5"><span>VOL.3 园长vs主任：创业两年半，未来却想“走”</span></a></p><span></span><p><strong><span>BGM丨</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>《Lemon Tea 》—— GYVUS</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lnAdmhIFEGuxJhIjSpfwUh_Ko70G.m4a" length="64112232" type="audio/mp4"/>
